# {{projectName}}

Built with Angular + Feature Modules (NgModules).

## Stack
- **Framework:** Angular (NgModules)
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useMaterial}}
- **UI:** Angular Material
{{/if}}
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
- **Tests:** Jest + jest-preset-angular
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
- **E2E:** Playwright
{{/if}}

## Commands
```bash
npm start        # Start dev server
npm run build    # Production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```

## Project Structure
```
src/app/
  app.component.ts      # Root component
  app.routes.ts         # Route definitions (lazy-loaded modules)
  home/                 # Home page (standalone)
  {{#each modules}}
  {{this}}/
    {{this}}.module.ts         # NgModule
    {{this}}.routes.ts         # Feature routes
    {{this}}.component.ts      # Feature component
    {{this}}.component.spec.ts # Tests
    {{this}}.service.ts        # Feature service
  {{/each}}
```
